{"translation-revision-date":"2026-04-21 22:12:11+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.0.3","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=3; plural=(n == 1) ? 0 : ((n >= 2 && n <= 4) ? 1 : 2);","lang":"cs_CZ"},"Only typography settings supported in Global Fonts will be applied, including: font family, responsive font sizes, weight, text transform, decoration, line height, letter spacing, and word spacing. Changes made in the class will automatically apply to Global Fonts.":["Pou\u017eij\u00ed se jen ta nastaven\u00ed typografie, kter\u00e1 glob\u00e1ln\u00ed p\u00edsma podporuj\u00ed, konkr\u00e9tn\u011b: rodina p\u00edsma, responzivn\u00ed velikosti, \u0159ez, transformace textu, dekorace, v\u00fd\u0161ka \u0159\u00e1dku, proklad p\u00edsmen a mezery mezi slovy. Zm\u011bny proveden\u00e9 ve t\u0159\u00edd\u011b se automaticky prom\u00edtnou do glob\u00e1ln\u00edch p\u00edsem."],"Sync class to Global Fonts":["Synchronizovat t\u0159\u00eddu s glob\u00e1ln\u00edmi p\u00edsmy"],"Don't show again":["Znovu nezobrazovat"],"Note that if it's being used anywhere, the affected elements will inherit the default typography.":["Upozor\u0148ujeme, \u017ee pokud se n\u011bkde pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1, dot\u010den\u00e9 prvky p\u0159evezmou v\u00fdchoz\u00ed typografii."],"You're about to stop syncing a typography class to Global Fonts.":["Chyst\u00e1te se zru\u0161it synchronizaci typografick\u00e9 t\u0159\u00eddy s glob\u00e1ln\u00edmi p\u00edsmy."],"Un-sync typography class":["Zru\u0161it synchronizaci typografick\u00e9 t\u0159\u00eddy"],"Sync to Global Fonts":["Synchronizovat s glob\u00e1ln\u00edmi p\u00edsmy"],"Stop syncing to Global Fonts":["Zastavit synchronizaci s glob\u00e1ln\u00edmi p\u00edsmy"],"Go to Class Manager":["P\u0159ej\u00edt do Spr\u00e1vce t\u0159\u00edd"],"Only the prefixes were added. Find them in Class Manager by searching":["Byly p\u0159id\u00e1ny jen p\u0159edpony. Ve Spr\u00e1vci t\u0159\u00edd je najdete pomoc\u00ed vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed."],"Your designs and classes are safe.":["Va\u0161e n\u00e1vrhy a t\u0159\u00eddy jsou v bezpe\u010d\u00ed."],"Some new classes used the same names as existing ones. To prevent conflicts, we added the prefix":["N\u011bkter\u00e9 nov\u00e9 t\u0159\u00eddy m\u011bly stejn\u00e9 n\u00e1zvy jako u\u017e existuj\u00edc\u00ed t\u0159\u00eddy. Aby nedo\u0161lo ke konflikt\u016fm, p\u0159idali jsme p\u0159edponu"],"Unused":["Nepou\u017eit\u00e9"],"Sorry, nothing matched that search.":["Je n\u00e1m l\u00edto, tomuto vyhled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed nic neodpov\u00edd\u00e1."],"Sorry, nothing matched.":["Omlouv\u00e1me se, nic nebylo nalezeno."],"class":["t\u0159\u00edda"],"classes":["t\u0159\u00eddy"],"Delete this class?":["Smazat tuto t\u0159\u00eddu?"],"Sorry, nothing matched":["Omlouv\u00e1me se, nic nebylo nalezeno"],"Rename":["P\u0159ejmenovat"],"Clear all":["Vypr\u00e1zdnit v\u0161e"],"Got it":["M\u00e1m to"],"Footer":["Pati\u010dka"],"Header":["Hlavi\u010dka"],"Post":["P\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek"],"Empty":["Pr\u00e1zdn\u00fd"],"More actions":["V\u00edce akc\u00ed"],"Search":["Hledat"],"Page":["Str\u00e1nka"],"After":["Po"],"Before":["P\u0159ed"],"Cancel":["Zru\u0161it"],"Delete":["Odstranit"],"Discard":["Odhodit"]}},"comment":{"reference":"assets\/js\/packages\/editor-global-classes\/editor-global-classes.js"}}